        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 7:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu mwaka ugira kane umwami Dariyusi ari ku ngoma, ijambo ry’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.7.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ryaje kuri Zakariya ku musi ugira kane w’ukwezi kw’icenda, ari kwo Kisilevu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.7.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 7:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu b’i Beteli bari batumye Sharezeri na Regemu-Meleki, hamwe n’abantu babo, ngo babasigurize ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.7.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.7.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 7:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mu kubaza abaherezi bo mu Ngoro y’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.7.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " Mushoboravyose n’abavugishwa n’Imana ngo: “Tuzobandanya kuboroga no kwisonzesha mu kwezi kugira gatanu, nk’uko twagumye tubigira muri iyi myaka yose ishize, twibuka umusi urusengero rwasamburwa?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.7.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 7:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.7.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 7:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.7.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.7.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " Mushoboravyose yongera kumbwira ijambo ati: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.7.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.7.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 7:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Baza abantu bo mu gihugu hamwe n’abaherezi uti: ‘Hamwe mwisonzesha mukaboroga mu kwezi kugira gatanu no mu kugira indwi muri iyi myaka iheze uko ari mirongo indwi, mbega harya vy’ukuri mwisonzesha ku bwanje? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.7.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 7:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi igihe mwarya mukanywa, ntimwaba muriko murinezereza mwebwe ubwanyu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.7.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 7:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbega aya si yo majambo ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.7.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.7.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " yabamenyesheje ayacishije mu bo yavugisha ba kera igihe Yerusalemu n’ibisagara vyari bihakikije vyari mu mutekano kandi vyuzuye ubutunzi, na Negebu n’ibiyaya vyaho bikirimwo abantu?’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.7.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.7.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 7:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.7.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.7.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 7:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze ijambo ry’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.7.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ryongera kuza kuri Zakariya riti: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.7.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 7:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Uku ni ko ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.7.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.7.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " Mushoboravyose avuze: ‘Nimuce imanza zibereye; mugire imbabazi mubabarane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.7.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.7.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 7:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ntimucinyize umupfakazi n’impfuvyi, inyambukira canke umukene. Ntimugire inama yo kugirira abandi nabi.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.7.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.7.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 7:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.7.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.7.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 7:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko banka kwumva; bakomantaza imitima yabo bantera ibitugu biziba amatwi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.7.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.7.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 7:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Imitima yabo barayikomantaza bayigira nk’ibuye ntibumvira ivyagezwe n’amajambo y’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.7.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " Mushoboravyose yari yabatumyeko akoresheje Mpwemu wiwe yavugisha abavugishwa biwe ba kera. Ni co catumye ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.7.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " Mushoboravyose araka cane.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.7.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 7:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.7.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 7:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "‘Aho nahamagara, ntibanyumvirije; ni co catumye igihe bahamagara, nanje ntabumvirije,’ ni ko ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.7.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.7.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " Mushoboravyose avuze. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.7.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.7.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 7:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "‘Nabasanzarishije agashururu mu mahanga yose, aho babaye inyambukira. Igihugu bavuyemwo casigaye ari imisaka ku buryo ata muntu yagicamwo. Uko ni ko bahinduye imisaka ico gihugu c’igikundiro.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.7.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.7.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
